          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"inspect-the-typed-model-and-restriction-card\">Inspect the typed model and restriction card</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The loader has now left the Python UFO object model behind. Particle, parameter, coupling, and vertex lookups use FeynKit's typed API. Zero widths in the restriction card become internal zero parameters during simplification, leaving the coupling and two nonzero masses as independent numerical inputs.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
