            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"reuse-the-model-in-diagram-generation\">Reuse the model in diagram generation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Nothing downstream is UFO-specific. Generate diagrams directly from the\nloaded <code>model</code>; selectors, generation options, graph inspection, CFF\nconstruction, and Symbolica expressions all compose unchanged.</span></span>"
